The limit on the number of processes the user of a process of the container can have at one time.
The kernel counts the processes of the user on the whole node, not in the container.

The engine sets the soft and the hard limit to this value, as `--ulimit
nproc=<value>:<value>`, which overrides its default ulimit and the `--ulimit nproc`
of `run_args`. Unset, the container runs with the default of the engine.
